title: Deprecate the legacy staking pallets
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    `pallet-staking`, `pallet-fast-unstake` and `pallet-election-provider-multi-phase` are deprecated and will be removed after November 2027. Use `pallet-staking-async` instead, with `pallet-election-provider-multi-block` for elections.
crates:
- name: pallet-staking
  bump: minor
